DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41593::$$$message_0314_0000_0000$$$::"Argh, these! [br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01i(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01i(中)][wshock canskip=0][lquake vmax=5 hmax=5 storage=凛巫女服01i(中)] I saw these decorating the ceiling at Sankaido, but they told me they weren't for sale and wouldn't let me buy them."::
41594::$$$message_0314_0001_0000$$$::"Who are you talking about?[br][cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01k(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01k(中)]You're probably thinking of the throwing daggers made by the Azande or Bobangui people of Central Africa."::
41595::$$$message_0314_0002_0000$$$::"Are these not that? They're Noble Phantasms?"::
41596::$$$message_0314_0003_0000$$$::"No, not Noble Phantasms. They simply have a unique shape.[lr]::
41597::$$$message_0314_0003_0001$$$::They're weapons like Berserker's axe-sword that just happened to come with him."::
41598::$$$message_0314_0004_0000$$$::"Tell me more."::
41599::$$$message_0314_0005_0000$$$::"I can describe their technical specs, at least.[lr]::
41600::$$$message_0314_0005_0001$$$::These weapons, Tawrich (left) and Zarich (right), are held in a backward grip."::
41601::$$$message_0314_0006_0000$$$::"The left traps the enemy's weapon, while the right is used to strike."::
41602::$$$message_0314_0007_0000$$$::"Alternately, Hidari-shishigami and Migi-shishigami,[br]if we were to convert their names to Japanese."::
41603::$$$message_0314_0008_0000$$$::"They're obviously modeled after animal teeth.[lr]::
41604::$$$message_0314_0008_0001$$$::The teeth of actual demons may have been objects of worship, during the time these were made."::
41605::$$$message_0314_0009_0000$$$::"Demon teeth...[wvl canskip=0 time=800][se storage=se410.wav] (gulp)"::
V